%% Device and consent approval with the approver decision (CHAOS-13586).
%% Page: web docs/auth-acr-device-approval.md. Code: internal/auth/approver_reference.go,
%% internal/auth/approval_decision.go, internal/auth/device_flow.go (approveUserCodeHash).
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant W as web server
    participant A as acr-api
    participant P as auth-service (policy decision point)
    B->>W: approve (session cookie)
    W->>W: session read, impersonation read, W9-13 decision (user access token)
    W->>A: POST approval + X-ACR-Web-Assertion (aud acr-api, 30 s, jti once) + X-ACR-Approver-Reference (aud auth-service, 30 s, req = SHA-256 of the assertion)
    A->>A: verify assertion (key, iss, aud, method, path, body, jti record)
    A->>A: pair check (req, sub, org_id, impersonating, sid if signed, not outliving the assertion)
    A->>A: local checks (impersonation, organization state, repositories within the grant)
    A->>P: POST /v1/authorize (acr-api workload token; principal_reference = approver reference; acr.credential.issue on the organization)
    P->>P: caller is acr-api, verify reference (web JWKS), sid live and owned by sub (no cache)
    P-->>A: decision (allow + obligations, or deny)
    alt allow (or mode off/shadow)
        A->>A: store the approval
        A-->>W: 200
    else deny or no valid reference (enforce)
        A-->>W: 403 access_denied (authorization stays pending)
    else no decision (enforce)
        A-->>W: 503
    end
